この　ショップキットを　もっていれば

en:
This is a Shop Kit, the item you need to
build an item shop.{KP}
As long as you have this Shop Kit,

Houses, where Dyna live, can be built
without any kit,{KP}
so please build as many as you need.

There is one more thing. Let me tell you
about Dyna that are handy{KP}
for getting around the city.

and read the Keywords in the Database.{KP}
I am sure they will come in handy later
on.

First, choose Level to turn the sector into
Ground.{KP}
Otherwise, you cannot build any facilities.

jp:
たてることができる　しせつが
ひょうじされました{KP}
では　ハウスを　えらんでください

en:
The facilities you can build are now
shown.{KP}
Please choose House.

jp:
ここでは　ハウスを　えらんでください{KP}
ダイナが　くらす　いえを
たてることができます

en:
Please choose House here.{KP}
It lets you build a home for Dyna to live
in.

jp:
このままでは　まわりに　わるい
えいきょうを　あたえるので{KP}
きれいに　かたづけておきましょう

en:
Left like this, it has a bad effect on its
surroundings,{KP}
so let's clean it up.

Please choose Build here.{KP}
A list of the facilities you can build will
appear.

Here, take this! It's a Colosseum Kit, the
thing you need to build a Battle{KP}
Colosseum.

So you're building it here? Okay, first{KP}
bring along the Dyna you want to enter in
battles,

jp:
バトルリストに　とうろくしてきてね{KP}
あ・・・リストとうろくっていうのは　いえに
すんでいる　ダイナと　はなして

en:
and sign it up on the Battle List.{KP}
Oh... signing up means you talk to a Dyna
living in a house

jp:
・・・もしかして　もう
バトルに　だしたい　ダイナって{KP}
